 "kind": "credential",
 "definition": "A pilot qualification, added to a pilot licence or certificate, that allows flying by reference to cockpit instruments in cloud and poor visibility under instrument flight rules.",
 "description": {
  "text": "An instrument rating is the qualification a pilot needs to fly under instrument flight rules. It requires training beyond a private or commercial pilot certificate, including meteorology and flying solely by reference to instruments.",
